            "zh": "<color=green>【TRI-OS Plug-in:Interrupt】</color>\nSystem Interrupted.\n\n尚未选择必须选项。\n\n<color=green>『STORY27：新·神乐』</color>\n请在其中做出选择后\n再次访问。\n",
